---
title: Join Us
layout: base.njk
permalink: /join/
---
{% import "cta-dragonpass.njk" as cta %}
{% import "icon.njk" as ic %}

<section class="hero" style="background-image: url('{{ '/assets/photo-hero-2.jpg' | url }}');">
  <div class="hero__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow mono-label">{{ ic.icon("activity", 16) }} Come and try</span>
    <h1 class="hero__title">Your first session is</h1>
    <span class="brush">free.</span>
    <p class="hero__lead">
      No boat, no paddle, no experience &mdash; just show up. A Dragon Pass gets you a full month
      of training with the club before you decide whether to join. Wear clothes you can move
      and get wet in, bring a water bottle and a towel; we supply the boat, paddles, and PFDs.
    </p>
    <div class="hero__ctas">
      {{ cta.ctaDragonPass("Get your Dragon Pass", site.dragonPassUrl) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--surface">
  <div class="container">
    {% set next = schedule.sessions[0] %}
    <div class="session-callout reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="mono-label" style="color: var(--red)">Next session</span>
        {% if next.cancelled %}
        <h2>Session cancelled</h2>
        <p>Check TeamApp or Facebook for the latest update.</p>
        {% else %}
        <h2>{{ next.day }} &middot; {{ next.time }}</h2>
        <p>{{ next.notes }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--calendar" href="{{ site.teamAppUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {{ ic.icon("calendar-event", 18) }} Open TeamApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--surface">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="divider mono-label">{{ ic.icon("sailboat", 16) }} Your first session</div>
    <ol class="first-session">
      <li class="first-session__step reveal">
        <span class="first-session__number">01</span>
        <span class="first-session__icon">{{ ic.icon("calendar-event", 24) }}</span>
        <h3>Get your Dragon Pass</h3>
        <p>Register once online. Your first month of club training is free.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="first-session__step reveal">
        <span class="first-session__number">02</span>
        <span class="first-session__icon">{{ ic.icon("map-pin", 24) }}</span>
        <h3>Meet the crew</h3>
        <p>Arrive by 8:00 am for induction and PFD fitting. Come in clothes you can move and get wet in, and bring water and a towel.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="first-session__step reveal">
        <span class="first-session__number">03</span>
        <span class="first-session__icon">{{ ic.icon("sailboat", 24) }}</span>
        <h3>We sort the gear</h3>
        <p>We provide the boat, paddle and PFD, then show you the basics before you launch.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="first-session__step reveal">
        <span class="first-session__number">04</span>
        <span class="first-session__icon">{{ ic.icon("users", 24) }}</span>
        <h3>Paddle as a crew</h3>
        <p>No experience needed. Follow the stroke, learn the rhythm and see how it feels.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="join-coaches-note">Our coaches will guide you through your first session.
      <a href="{{ '/about/' | url }}#coaches">Meet our coaches {{ ic.icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="divider mono-label">{{ ic.icon("map-pin", 16) }} Where we train</div>
    <p>{{ site.location }}</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get directions {{ ic.icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a></p>
    <div style="margin-top: var(--space-4); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border);">
      <iframe title="Map showing Community Boating Hub at 912 Collins Street, Docklands" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Community%20Boating%20Hub%2C%20912%20Collins%20Street%2C%20Docklands%20VIC%203008&output=embed" width="100%" height="320" style="display: block; border: 0;" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--surface">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="divider mono-label">{{ ic.icon("users", 16) }} Before you paddle</div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>Facilities</h3>
        <p>The Community Boating Hub has toilets, change rooms, showers, and lockers/storage available.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>Health & accessibility</h3>
        <p>Dragon boating can range from recreational to competitive intensity. If you are managing a medical condition, injury, disability, or accessibility need, talk with your health professional and let the YRD crew know before your session so participation can be adapted where appropriate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>Weather & cancellations</h3>
        <p>If a session is cancelled, members will be updated in TeamApp and/or on the YRD Facebook page. If conditions look uncertain, check for an update before leaving home.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--surface">
  <div class="glow-field"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Already a member?</h2>
    <p>Head to TeamApp for schedules, crew lists, and club communication.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.teamAppUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open TeamApp {{ ic.icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
  </div>
</section>
